every file that a patch modifies (149 files). "Header" means the licence header
at the top of the modified upstream files.

| Project (AOSP path)              | Licence                  | Basis |
| -------------------------------- | ------------------------ | ----- |
| frameworks/base                  | Apache-2.0               | NOTICE and MODULE_LICENSE_APACHE2 in the project root; header on 48 of 55 modified files |
| packages/modules/Bluetooth       | Apache-2.0               | NOTICE and MODULE_LICENSE_APACHE2 in the project root; header on 19 of 26 modified files |
| packages/apps/Launcher3          | Apache-2.0               | Header on all 5 modified upstream files; the project root has no licence file |
| packages/apps/Settings           | Apache-2.0               | NOTICE in the project root; header on 16 of 17 modified files |
| packages/inputmethods/LatinIME   | Apache-2.0               | NOTICE in the project root; header on all 24 modified files |
| packages/apps/Multiuser          | Apache-2.0               | Header on both modified files (AOSP tag android-17.0.0_r1) |
| device/generic/goldfish          | Apache-2.0               | Header on both modified files; the project root has no licence file |
| system/core                      | Apache-2.0               | MODULE_LICENSE_APACHE2 marker in the project root; the one modified file has no header |
| packages/apps/Updater            | MIT                      | LICENSE in the project root (GrapheneOS) |
| vendor/adevtool                  | MIT                      | LICENSE in the project root (GrapheneOS) |
