Upstream files without a header that a patch modifies are data or build files
(AndroidManifest.xml, system-current.txt, init.rc, *.te, *.yml, *.mk, Android.bp)
or two Java sources (SettingsLib Utils.java and DuressPasswordHelper.java, both
in frameworks/base). They fall under the licence of their project in the table.

The other files without a header are created by the patches themselves (15
files: 4 in frameworks/base, 7 in packages/apps/Launcher3 and 4 in
packages/modules/Bluetooth) and are covered by the rule under "LICENCE".

